!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/a1e61e0565ae53508c6d0c1541ca3656.webp?t=1729167127\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/1af908af7b57a807e485fede11e32bd6.poster.avif?t=1729167127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/1af908af7b57a807e485fede11e32bd6.webm?t=1729167127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/57a0300cc547747bcd419ba2512b8108.poster.avif?t=1729167127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/57a0300cc547747bcd419ba2512b8108.webm?t=1729167127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/febd30fd0eb4f4fab3cd52836890ebec.poster.avif?t=1729167127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780670/extras/febd30fd0eb4f4fab3cd52836890ebec.webm?t=1729167127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></li></ul>",
